shamed"},{"surface":"மறத்தகை","parts":[{"text":"மறத்தகை","lemma":"மறத்தகை","gloss":"valorous nature"}],"gloss":"valorous nature","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மன்னன்","parts":[{"text":"மன்னன்","lemma":"maṉṉaṉ","gloss":"king"}],"gloss":"king"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வாள்","parts":[{"text":"வாள்","lemma":"vāḷ","gloss":"sword"}],"gloss":"sword"},{"surface":"வடக்கு","parts":[{"text":"வடக்கு","lemma":"vaṭakku","gloss":"north"}],"gloss":"north"},{"surface":"இருந்தனன்","parts":[{"text":"இருந்தனன்","lemma":"இருந்தனன்","gloss":"he sat"}],"gloss":"he sat","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"ஈங்கு","parts":[{"text":"ஈங்கு","lemma":"īṅku","gloss":"here"}],"gloss":"here"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நாள்போல்","parts":[{"text":"நாள்","lemma":"nāḷ","gloss":"day"},{"text":"போல்","lemma":"pōl","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like ordinary days"},{"surface":"கழியல","parts":[{"text":"கழி","lemma":"kaḻi","gloss":"pass"},{"text":"அல","lemma":"ala","gloss":"they are not"}],"gloss":"they do not pass"},{"surface":"ஞாயிற்றுப்","parts":[{"text":"ஞாயிற்றுப்","lemma":"ஞாயிற்றுப்","gloss":"of the sun"}],"gloss":"of the sun","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பகலே","parts":[{"text":"பகல்","lemma":"pakal","gloss":"daytime"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ē","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"the daytime indeed"}]}],"literal":"Clay-drum being forgotten, melody of the lute being forgotten, / wide-mouthed pot being overturned and ghee being lost, / bees-swarming honey-liquor being forgotten by kinsmen, / ploughmen's clamour being forgotten, and even the festival / in the wide places of the small villages being forgotten, / on the great day when the full moon occurred, / the two luminaries looking at each other, as one luminary / hid behind the mountain in the sorrowful evening, / ashamed of the back-wound struck by a king of equal strength who aimed at his front, / the valorous king / sat facing north with his sword here; / the daytime of the sun does not pass like ordinary days.","translation":"The clay-topped drums are forgotten, and the melodies of the lutes are forgotten. The wide-mouthed pots lie overturned, their ghee spilt and wasted. The kinsmen have forgotten the honey-liquor where bees swarm. The clamour of the ploughmen is forgotten, and even the festivals in the wide streets of small villages are forgotten. On the great day of the full moon, when the two great luminaries look at each other, just as one luminary hides behind the mountain in the sorrowful evening, the valorous king, ashamed of a wound on his back struck by an equal king who had aimed at his front, has sat facing north with his sword here. Therefore, the daytime of the sun does not pass like ordinary days.","modern":"மண்ணால் மூடிய முரசு முழங்குவதை மக்கள் மறந்துவிட்டனர்; யாழின் இசையையும் மறந்துவிட்டனர். அகன்ற வாயையுடைய நெய்ப்பானைகள் கவிழ்ந்து நெய் வீணாகப் போகிறது. வண்டுகள் மொய்க்கும் தேனைச் சுற்றத்தார் குடிக்க மறந்துவிட்டனர். உழவர்களின் ஆரவாரம் ஓய்ந்துவிட்டது; அகன்ற இடங்களைக் கொண்ட சிற்றூர்களில் திருவிழாக்களும் மறந்துபோயின. பௌர்ணமி நாளில் சூரியனும் சந்திரனும் நேருக்கு நேர் பார்த்துக் கொள்ளும்போது, ஒரு சுடர் (சூரியன்) துன்பம் தரும் மாலைப் பொழுதில் மலையின் பின்னே மறைவது போல, தனக்கு நிகரான சோழ மன்னன் தன் மார்பைக் குறிவைத்து எறிந்த வேல் தன் முதுகில் பாய்ந்துவிட்டதே என்று நாணி, வீரமிக்க சேர மன்னன் தன் வாளோடு வடக்கிருந்து உயிர் துறக்கத் துணிந்துவிட்டான். இதனால், சூரியனுடைய பகல் பொழுதுகள் வழக்கமான நாட்களைப் போல எளிதில் கழியாமல் நீண்டு கிடக்கின்றன.","explanation":"The poet Kaḻāattalaiyār laments the tragic decision of the Cēra king Peruñcēralātaṉ to fast to death. During the battle of Veṇṇi, the king was wounded in the back by an arrow shot by Karikāl Peruvaḷattāṉ. Ashamed of this back-wound (puṟappuṇ), which was considered a dishonor for a warrior, the king undertook the ritual fast unto death facing north (vaṭakkiruttal) with his sword. The poet describes how the entire land has fallen into deep mourning, with music, festivals, and farming activities completely forgotten. He compares the king's impending death to the setting of the sun on a full moon evening, and notes that the grief is so heavy that the daytime seems to stretch endlessly.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.44],[0.52,1.03],[1.11,1.2],[1.2,1.5],[1.5,1.8],[1.8,2.9],[2.9,2.9],[2.9,3.3],[3.3,3.8],[3.8,4.4],[4.58,5.5],[5.5,5.9],[5.9,6.0],[6.0,6.3],[6.3,7.3],[7.3,7.5],[7.5,7.7],[7.7,8.0],[8.0,9.2],[9.2,9.3],[9.3,9.9],[9.9,10.3],[10.3,10.3],[10.3,11.4],[11.4,11.6],[11.6,12.0],[12.0,13.3],[13.3,13.5],[13.5,13.9],[13.9,14.2],[14.2,14.4],[14.4,15.1],[15.1,15.4],[15.4,15.83],[15.83,16.3],[17.04,17.74],[17.74,17.84],[17.84,18.34],[18.34,18.54],[18.54,18.84],[18.84,20.14],[20.14,20.24],[20.24,20.94],[20.94,21.34],[21.34,22.04],[22.04,22.54],[22.54,22.74],[22.74,23.04],[23.04,24.44],[24.44,24.44],[24.44,25.64],[25.64,25.74]],"female":[[0.0,0.52],[0.56,1.1],[1.2,1.3],[1.3,1.7],[1.7,2.0],[2.0,3.2],[3.2,3.6],[3.6,3.6],[3.6,4.2],[4.2,5.01],[5.01,5.82],[6.14,6.3],[6.3,7.4],[7.4,7.6],[7.6,8.5],[8.5,8.7],[8.7,8.9],[8.9,9.2],[9.2,10.8],[10.8,10.9],[10.9,11.5],[11.5,12.0],[12.0,12.9],[12.9,13.3],[13.3,13.5],[13.5,14.0],[14.0,15.5],[15.5,15.7],[15.7,16.1],[16.1,16.4],[16.4,16.6],[16.6,17.5],[17.5,17.9],[17.9,18.59],[18.59,19.0],[19.64,20.24],[20.24,20.44],[20.44,21.04],[21.04,21.14],[21.14,21.44],[21.44,22.74],[22.74,22.74],[22.74,23.54],[23.54,24.04],[24.04,24.64],[24.64,24.84],[24.84,25.14],[25.14,25.74],[25.74,27.61],[27.61,27.68],[27.84,28.44],[28.44,28.54]]},"sync":[[["மண்முழா","clay-topped drum"]],[["மறப்பப்","being forgotten"]],[["பண்","melody"]],[["யாழ்","lute"]],[["மறப்ப","being forgotten"]],[["இருங்கண்","wide-mouthed"]],[["குழிசி","pot"]],[["கவிழ்ந்து","having turned over"]],[["இழுது","ghee"]],[["பறப்பச்","being spilt and lost"]],[["சுரும்பூஆர்","where bees swarm to drink"]],[["தேறல்","honey-liquor"]],[["சுற்றம்","kinsmen"]],[["மறப்ப","forgetting"]],[["உழவர்","ploughmen"]],[["ஓதை","clamour"]],[["மறப்ப","forgetting"]],[["விழவும்","and the festival"]],[["அகலுள்","wide streets"]],[["ஆங்கண்","in th